<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>The Auction Room Bangladesh</title>

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background: #050505;
      color: white;
    }

    nav {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 20px 8%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.75);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      z-index: 1000;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #2b2b2b;
    }

    nav h2 {
      color: #d4af37;
    }

    nav a {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-left: 25px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      color: #d4af37;
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 120px 8% 60px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 50px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.75), rgba(0,0,0,0.95)),
        url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1642790106117-e829e14a795f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80");
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 58px;
      line-height: 1.1;
      color: #d4af37;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .hero h3 {
      font-size: 26px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .hero p {
      color: #cfcfcf;
      font-size: 18px;
      max-width: 650px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 30px;
      background: #d4af37;
      color: #000;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-right: 10px;
    }

    .btn-outline {
      background: transparent;
      color: #d4af37;
      border: 1px solid #d4af37;
    }

    .profile-card {
      background: rgba(17,17,17,0.9);
      padding: 25px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      border: 1px solid #d4af37;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(212,175,55,0.15);
    }

    .profile-card img {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 330px;
      height: 400px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 18px;
      border: 2px solid #d4af37;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .profile-card h2 {
      color: #d4af37;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    section {
      padding: 80px 8%;
    }

    .section-title {
      text-align: center;
      color: #d4af37;
      font-size: 38px;
      margin-bottom: 45px;
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
      gap: 25px;
    }

    .card {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #111, #080808);
      border: 1px solid #2b2b2b;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-8px);
      border-color: #d4af37;
      box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(212,175,55,0.12);
    }

    .card h3 {
      color: #d4af37;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      font-size: 22px;
    }

    .card p, .card li {
      color: #cfcfcf;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    ul {
      padding-left: 20px;
    }

    .strategy {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #111, #211906);
      border-left: 5px solid #d4af37;
      padding: 35px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    .image-section {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 35px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .image-section img {
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 18px;
      border: 1px solid #d4af37;
    }

    .contact {
      text-align: center;
      background: #080808;
    }

    footer {
      padding: 25px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #888;
      border-top: 1px solid #222;
      background: #030303;
    }

    @media(max-width: 850px) {
      .hero, .image-section {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 42px;
      }

      nav {
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 10px;
      }

      nav a {
        margin: 8px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <nav>
    <h2>The Auction Room BD</h2>
    <div>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#strategy">Strategy</a>
      <a href="#tools">Tools</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <div class="hero">
    <div>
      <h1>Trade Like an Auction Reader</h1>
      <h3>Auction Market Theory | Order Flow | Liquidity</h3>
      <p>
        I focus on reading market behavior using Volume Profile, TPO, Bookmap Heatmap,
        Footprint Charts, Delta, LVN, VAH, VAL, Absorption and Liquidity.
      </p>
      <a href="#strategy" class="btn">My Strategy</a>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-outline">Join Community</a>
    </div>

    <div class="profile-card">
      <img src="profile.jpg" alt="Al Shahriar Hossain Oni">
      <h2>Al Shahriar Hossain Oni</h2>
      <p>Founder of The Auction Room Bangladesh</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section id="about">
    <h2 class="section-title">About My Trading</h2>

    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Auction Market Theory</h3>
        <p>I study how price moves between balance and imbalance while searching for fair value.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Volume Profile</h3>
        <p>I use VAH, VAL, POC, HVN and LVN to identify acceptance, rejection and key auction zones.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Order Flow</h3>
        <p>I read delta, footprint imbalance, absorption, exhaustion and trapped traders.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Heatmap Liquidity</h3>
        <p>I use Bookmap to observe liquidity stacking, pulling, absorption and reaction zones.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="strategy">
    <h2 class="section-title">My Trading Strategy</h2>

    <div class="strategy">
      <h3 style="color:#d4af37; margin-bottom:15px;">Core Framework</h3>
      <p>
        I do not trade random support and resistance. I wait for price to reach important auction
        areas like LVN, VAH, VAL, POC, liquidity pools, previous highs/lows or unfinished auction zones.
        Then I confirm with order flow and heatmap behavior.
      </p>

      <br>

      <ul>
        <li>Price near VAH, VAL, LVN, POC or liquidity zone</li>
        <li>Clear rejection or acceptance from value area</li>
        <li>Heatmap liquidity reaction or absorption</li>
        <li>Delta confirmation or divergence</li>
        <li>Exhaustion at top or bottom</li>
        <li>Clean stop loss and risk management</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="image-section">
    <div>
      <h2 style="color:#d4af37; font-size:36px; margin-bottom:20px;">Institutional Style Analysis</h2>
      <p style="color:#cfcfcf; line-height:1.8;">
        My focus is understanding where big participants are active, where retail traders are trapped,
        and where liquidity is likely to be targeted. Every trade must have a reason based on auction logic,
        not emotion.
      </p>
    </div>

    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611974789855-9c2a0a7236a3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" alt="Trading Chart">
  </section>

  <section id="tools">
    <h2 class="section-title">Tools I Use</h2>

    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Bookmap</h3>
        <p>Heatmap, liquidity, absorption and order book behavior.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>MotiveWave</h3>
        <p>Footprint chart, volume profile, delta and execution analysis.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>TPO / Market Profile</h3>
        <p>Balance, imbalance, value migration and auction structure.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Risk Management</h3>
        <p>Every setup must have defined risk before entry.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" class="contact">
    <h2 class="section-title">Join The Auction Room Bangladesh</h2>
    <p style="color:#cfcfcf; margin-bottom:25px;">
      Learn Auction Market Theory, Order Flow, Liquidity and Professional Trading Concepts.
    </p>
    <a href="#" class="btn">Contact Me</a>
  </section>

  <footer>
    © 2026 The Auction Room Bangladesh | Al Shahriar Hossain Oni
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
